<% content_for :title, "About · Mixomancer" %>

<div class="w-full max-w-3xl space-y-6">
  <header>
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight text-zinc-50">About</h1>
    <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-zinc-500">
      Ruby <%= RUBY_VERSION %> · Rails <%= Rails.version %> · host <%= Socket.gethostname %>
    </p>
  </header>

  <div class="space-y-4 text-lg text-zinc-300">
    <p>
      Household DJ for Meadow Circle. This Rails server will run the shop music queue.
      Groundwork already on haruna: NFS library from gluttony, mpv playlist, analog jack.
    </p>
    <p>
      The name is Mixomancer — a wizard who mixes. Not Mixalot / Sir Mix-a-Lot.
    </p>
  </div>

  <dl class="grid gap-4 rounded-xl border border-zinc-800 bg-zinc-900/60 p-5 text-sm sm:grid-cols-2">
    <div>
      <dt class="font-medium text-zinc-100">Library</dt>
      <dd class="mt-1 font-mono text-zinc-400">/mnt/audio_cds</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt class="font-medium text-zinc-100">Output</dt>
      <dd class="mt-1 text-zinc-400">Analog headphone jack on haruna</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt class="font-medium text-zinc-100">Default mix</dt>
      <dd class="mt-1 text-zinc-400">Guitar, then forest, rain, and songbirds, looping</dd>
    </div>
    <div>
      <dt class="font-medium text-zinc-100">Player</dt>
      <dd class="mt-1 font-mono text-zinc-400">audio-cds-queue.service</dd>
    </div>
  </dl>
</div>
